Some 26 new SKUs have been added to the Wicked Kitchen plant-based range, including All The Rage Rolls (k[ale],[ mushroom] and garlic in flaky puff pastry), Packed Puff Pie (ro[asted] caul[iflower] and oy[ster mushrooms] in brandy gravy), P[est]o Lasagne, Charred Pineapple Dream Cake and Spicy Mushroom and Veg Sourdough Pizza.
